//
// Each entry: codepoint, and cy = the glyph's visual-center height
// in staff spaces above the glyph origin. The canvas draws with
// textBaseline='alphabetic', so:
//   baselineY = wantCenterY + cy * staffSpace   (canvas y grows down)
// Clefs are the exception: their origin IS the reference staff line
// (G/F/C line), so cy is informational only for them.
// Rests: restWhole hangs from the origin (place origin on line 4),
// restHalf sits on the origin (place origin on line 3); the rest
// use their bbox center like noteheads.

